<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to April 7 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     419	   33,165     11,515</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 12		825	  372</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    1,923	  372</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     29,200</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		202	   46</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    2,362	  311</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  4		 71	   12</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    221	    7,889	2,197</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530))</p>
